@direct = http://localhost:5204
@gateway = http://localhost:5100
@token = paste-tenant-access-token
@tenantId = paste-tenant-id

### Health (direct)
GET {{direct}}/healthz

### Seed preview (direct, must equal manifest api.seed)
POST {{direct}}/internal/seed:preview

### Sample data through the gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/inventory/data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### Protected data through the gateway (needs INVENTORY_DATA_PROTECTED)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/inventory/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
